  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.5.0\n\nAdded\n- The title bar on Linux: `TitleBar.Extends` now draws the bar on Linux too when the app turns on Avalonia's drawn decorations (`X11PlatformOptions.EnableDrawnDecorations`, experimental in Avalonia 12; see the README). The window moves and snaps from the bar, maximises and restores on a double-click, resizes from its edges, and a right-click on the empty bar or the icon opens the window manager's own window menu. Tried on GNOME, KDE Plasma, Xfce and Cinnamon.\n- The gallery now also comes for Linux (x64).\n\nFixed\n- The media seek row's back-to-live button stays centred on the row, so its bottom is no longer cut off.",
